  "title": "Leftover Turkey Soup with Rosemary Parmesan Dumplings",
  "description": "Quick homemade dumplings complete this easy slow cooker soup made with leftover turkey carcass, veggies, and herbs.",
  "authors": [
    "SunnyDaysNora"
  ],
